 ## Unreleased — 1.4.0
 
-Nothing yet.
+The usage ledger (`.smysl/usage.log`) now lives under the user's home directory
+(`Ledger::default_path`) instead of the project it was invoked from. A project-rooted ledger
+reset itself every time `--store` pointed at a new checkout, so "how much have I spent" had as
+many answers as projects; rooting it at the home directory instead means one file accumulates
+across all of them. Falls back to the old relative path when the home directory cannot be
+determined - the ledger stays informational and never blocks a run (§23.1).
 
 ---
 
